    //
    //       string_format -- the loop that reads a format string and hands
    //       pieces of it to a writer, with the variadic ABI done by hand.
    //
    //       The integer save area sits at the top of the frame so it runs into
    //       the caller's stack arguments, which is where the compiler puts it
